sequenceDiagram
    participant OS as macOS
    participant App as Electron App
    participant Main as main.js
    participant Screen as screen API
    participant Win as BrowserWindow
    participant HTML as index.html
    participant Renderer as matrix.js
    participant Canvas as Canvas 2D

    OS->>App: Launch application
    App->>Main: app.whenReady
    Main->>Main: setupAutoLaunch
    Main->>Main: createTray with icon.png
    Note over Main: 1 second delay
    Main->>Screen: getAllDisplays
    Screen-->>Main: Display array with bounds

    loop For each display
        Main->>Win: new BrowserWindow with display.bounds
        Main->>Win: setVisibleOnAllWorkspaces true
        Main->>Win: setAlwaysOnTop desktop level -1
        Main->>Win: setIgnoreMouseEvents true
        Main->>Win: loadFile index.html
        Win->>HTML: Load DOM
        HTML->>Renderer: DOMContentLoaded
        Renderer->>Canvas: getContext 2d
        Renderer->>Renderer: resizeCanvas with DPR scaling
        Renderer->>Renderer: initializeDrops with DROP_DENSITY
        Renderer->>Canvas: requestAnimationFrame draw
        Note over Canvas: Animation loop begins at 30 FPS
        Win-->>Main: ready-to-show
        Main->>Win: win.show
    end

    Main->>Main: globalShortcut.register Cmd+Option+M
    Main->>Screen: on display-added/removed/changed
    Main->>Main: setupVisibilityChecker 60s interval
    Main->>Main: setupPositionChecker 5min interval
